  - type: 1
    sprite: {fileID: 1825658684, guid: 5665edff7b9f1634a9079e6d13f6b358, type: 3}
    description: Adds {value} armor. Each armor point can block one point of physical
      damage, after which it would be destroyed.
  - type: 2
    sprite: {fileID: 1338351883, guid: 5665edff7b9f1634a9079e6d13f6b358, type: 3}
    description: Restores {value} health, but less than the maximum health amount.
      Dispels poisoning.
  - type: 4
